    {
      "id": "numbers",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 292,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 162,
      "text": "• A mob break: 1 gold. Trees and hits on armor: 0.\n• Shops: cheap about 3, mid about 6, dear about 10.\n• Gold buys shop items only. No lives, no rerolls.\n• A drain: all gold lost.\n• Restock: after each dungeon.\n• Loot: 1 of 3 or none, from the shops’ pool.",
      "size": 18,
      "color": "#1f1b16"
    },
    {
      "id": "fits-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 482,
      "w": 624,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "How it fits",
      "size": 19,
      "weight": 700,
      "color": "#5b5f63",
      "caps": true
    },
    {
      "id": "fits-bar",
      "type": "rect",
      "name": "how it fits accent",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 518,
      "w": 6,
      "h": 81,
      "fill": "#5b5f63"
    },
    {
      "id": "fits",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 518,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 81,
      "text": "• Mobs are the gold and the way into dungeons, so the same shots do both (structure).\n• Armor pays nothing until it’s gone (challenge).",
      "size": 18,
      "color": "#1f1b16"
    },
    {
      "id": "open-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 627,
      "w": 624,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Open",
      "size": 19,
      "weight": 700,
      "color": "#2f6fd6",
      "caps": true
    },
    {
      "id": "open-bar",
      "type": "rect",
      "name": "open accent",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 663,
      "w": 6,
      "h": 108,
      "fill": "#2f6fd6"
    },
    {
      "id": "open",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 663,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 108,
      "text": "• How many mobs a quest spawns: that sets the gold per visit.\n• Does the shared pool get better each tier? Progression says higher-level loot can be game changers.\n• Unspent gold carries between dungeons unless you drain. Confirm.",
      "size": 18,
      "color": "#1f1b16"
    }
